### Sprint Approve API Examples with Authentication

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@accessToken = YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### ============================================
### Authentication
### ============================================

### 1. Register new user
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "teamId": 1,
  "role": "DEVELOPER"
}

### 2. Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 3. Refresh token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "YOUR_REFRESH_TOKEN_HERE"
}

### 4. Validate token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/validate?token={{accessToken}}

### ============================================
### Teams (Requires Authentication)
### ============================================

### Get all teams
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/teams
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Get team by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/teams/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Create team
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/teams
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Development Team",
  "description": "Main development team"
}

### Update team
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/teams/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Team Name",
  "description": "Updated description"
}

### Delete team
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/teams/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ============================================
### Users (Requires Authentication)
### ============================================

### Get all users
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Get user by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Get users by team
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/team/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Create user (with password)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jane Smith",
  "email": "jane@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "teamId": 1,
  "role": "DEVELOPER"
}

### Update user
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jane Smith Updated",
  "email": "jane.updated@example.com",
  "teamId": 1,
  "role": "TEAM_LEAD"
}

### Delete user
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ============================================
### Sprints (Requires Authentication)
### ============================================

### Get all sprints
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sprints
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Get sprint by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sprints/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Get sprints by team
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sprints/team/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Get sprints by status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sprints/status/CREATED
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Create sprint
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sprints
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sprint 1",
  "description": "First sprint",
  "teamId": 1,
  "type": "SPRINT",
  "createdBy": 1,
  "startDate": "2026-04-16",
  "endDate": "2026-04-30"
}

### Update sprint
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/sprints/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sprint 1 Updated",
  "description": "Updated description",
  "startDate": "2026-04-16",
  "endDate": "2026-05-01"
}

### Submit sprint for review
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/sprints/1/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Approve sprint
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/sprints/1/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Reject sprint
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/sprints/1/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Recalculate sprint status
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/sprints/1/recalculate-status
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Delete sprint
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/sprints/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ============================================
### Tasks (Requires Authentication)
### ============================================

### Get all tasks
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Get task by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Get tasks by sprint
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/sprint/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Get tasks by status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/status/CREATED
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Get tasks assigned to user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/assigned/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Create task
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Implement feature X",
  "description": "Detailed description",
  "sprintId": 1,
  "assignedTo": 1,
  "approverId": 2,
  "createdBy": 1
}

### Update task
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated task title",
  "description": "Updated description",
  "assignedTo": 1,
  "approverId": 2
}

### Submit task for review
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/1/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Approve task
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/1/approve?approverId=2
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Reject task
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/1/reject?approverId=2
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Delete task
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ============================================
### Artifacts (Requires Authentication)
### ============================================

### Get artifacts by task
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/artifacts/task/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Get artifact by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/artifacts/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Create artifact
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/artifacts
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "taskId": 1,
  "fileName": "document.pdf",
  "fileUrl": "https://example.com/files/document.pdf",
  "fileType": "PDF",
  "uploadedBy": 1
}

### Delete artifact
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/artifacts/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ============================================
### Comments (Requires Authentication)
### ============================================

### Get comments by task
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/comments/task/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Get comment by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/comments/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Create comment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "taskId": 1,
  "content": "This is a comment",
  "authorId": 1
}

### Update comment
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/comments/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Updated comment content"
}

### Delete comment
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/comments/1?authorId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
